       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. SIEVE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-LIMIT PIC 9999.
       01 WS-RESULT PIC 999 OCCURS 1000 TIMES. 
       01 WS-COUNT PIC 9999.
       01 PRIME-SIEVE.
           05 MY-NUMBER OCCURS 1000 TIMES
            INDEXED BY NUMBER-INDEX PIC 9(4) VALUE ZEROES.
       01 COMPOSITE-INDEX USAGE IS INDEX.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE 1000 TO WS-LIMIT.
           PERFORM SIEVE.
           DISPLAY PRIME-SIEVE.
           GOBACK.
       FILL-SIEVE.
           PERFORM VARYING NUMBER-INDEX FROM 2 BY 1
              UNTIL NUMBER-INDEX > WS-LIMIT OR NUMBER-INDEX > 1000
              MOVE NUMBER-INDEX TO MY-NUMBER(NUMBER-INDEX)
           END-PERFORM.
       DELETE-COMPOSITE-NUMBERS.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNT.
           PERFORM VARYING NUMBER-INDEX FROM 2 BY 1
              UNTIL NUMBER-INDEX > WS-LIMIT OR NUMBER-INDEX > 1000
              IF MY-NUMBER(NUMBER-INDEX) NOT = 0
                 PERFORM DELETE-PRIME-MULTIPLES
                 ADD 1 TO WS-COUNT
                 MOVE MY-NUMBER(NUMBER-INDEX) TO WS-RESULT(WS-COUNT)
              END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
       DELETE-PRIME-MULTIPLES.
           SET COMPOSITE-INDEX TO NUMBER-INDEX.
           SET COMPOSITE-INDEX UP BY MY-NUMBER(NUMBER-INDEX).
           PERFORM UNTIL COMPOSITE-INDEX > 1000
              OR COMPOSITE-INDEX > WS-LIMIT
              MOVE 0 TO MY-NUMBER(COMPOSITE-INDEX)
              SET COMPOSITE-INDEX UP BY MY-NUMBER(NUMBER-INDEX)
           END-PERFORM.
       SIEVE.
           PERFORM FILL-SIEVE THROUGH DELETE-COMPOSITE-NUMBERS.
       